+videos/            video index (unlisted YouTube links only)
 cmake/             build helpers, linker script, rule checks
+tools/             host-side scripts (cmake -P)
 external/mtk3_bsp  micro T-Kernel 3.0 BSP submodule (pinned, never edited)
