+| # | Template | Ours | Reason |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| T1 | SMP kernel copy; tasks pinned to a core (`TP_PRC1`/`TP_PRC2`, `TA_ASSPRC`) | Single-core `mtk3_bsp` (`pico_rp2040`); core 1 unused; `app_start_task()` has no core argument | Pinned official BSP; rule R5 |
